# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The skill works with NONE of these set — it falls back to first-principles
# on-chain checks over public/keyless infra. Everything here is an optional upgrade.
# Copy to .env and fill in what you have.  (.env is gitignored — never commit keys.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional: RugBurn-compatible risk engine (calibrated behavioral scores + deployer reputation)
# The URL is public — pre-filled. Only the API key is secret (get one at https://rugburn.io).
RUGBURN_API_URL=https://rugburn.io
RUGBURN_API_KEY=

# Optional: a keyed Solana RPC for richer/faster reads (Helius, Triton, QuickNode).
# Helius also unlocks the DAS holder-graph enumeration. Without it, the skill uses
# public RPC + the top-20 fallback (marked "partial").
SOLANA_RPC_URL=
HELIUS_API_KEY=

# Keyless agent access (QuickNode x402): no API key — an agent authenticates by paying
# per call from a funded wallet. The wallet's private key is loaded by the agent runtime
# securely and is NEVER placed in this file or committed. See skill/onchain-data-layer.md §0.
